WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,050
Hindi pa ba pwedeng magalit si Thief Huizong?

2
00:00:02,050 --> 00:00:04,240
Sa tingin mo ba maaalis mo ito? Nagkakaroon ako ng pantal.

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:08,650
Ang pinakamalalim na bahagi ng ancestral book

4
00:00:08,650 --> 00:00:13,080
Hubaran mo akong nakahubad

5
00:00:13,080 --> 00:00:15,080
How dare you bully my mother?

6
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:17,080
It's my turn to be a thief and I've been harmed by him.

7
00:00:17,080 --> 00:00:28,300
Hindi Papayagan ni Fang Xi si Ming Feng para gulohin ang Ancestor Emperor

8
00:00:28,300 --> 00:00:30,300
Nagiging sanhi ng pagkalanta ng mga aklat ng ninuno

9
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,300
Hindi na karapatdapat maging reyna

10
00:00:32,300 --> 00:00:36,190
Kung gusto mong agawin ang posisyon, sabihin mo lang.

11
00:00:36,190 --> 00:00:38,190
Hindi na kailangang gamitin ang isang bata bilang isang dahilan

12
00:00:38,190 --> 00:00:40,190
pagkatapos ng araw na ito
